flowchart TD
    O["Observe: source tree, base SHA, current manifest"] --> C["Choose: bounded scope and semantic version"]
    C --> A["Act: edit canonical sources, VERSION, CHANGELOG"]
    A --> V["Verify: tests, version gate, Mermaid renders, manifest"]
    V --> R["Record: commit, run, artifact, fingerprints, outcome"]
    R --> D{"New feedback changes the next action?"}
    D -->|yes| O
    D -->|no| T["Stop with named terminal state"]
    V --> P["PR review evidence"]
    P --> M["Merge after repository gates"]
    M --> W["Trusted master projection refresh"]
    W --> R
    V -->|failure| F["Classify evidence and repair"]
    F --> O
